d\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; font-stretch: 112%; color: #F2F0EA\">PublicPulse</span>\n</a>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #B9BDB6; max-width: 380px\">Bangladesh's 360° digital marketing and political PR agency. Political PR, social media, content production, paid ads, hospitality marketing, branding, SEO and analytics — under one roof in Dhaka.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 15px; color: #F2F0EA\">\n<a class=\"ulink\" href=\"tel:+8801717714676\" style=\"align-self: flex-start\">+880 1717-714676</a>\n<a class=\"ulink\" href=\"mailto:info@publicpulse.com.bd\" style=\"align-self: flex-start\">info@publicpulse.com.bd</a>\n<a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://share.google/g11S4Cxv9APnuvs92\" style=\"align-self: flex-start; color: #4BE38F\">Find us on Maps →</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<sc-for list=\"{{cols}}\" as=\"c\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<h3 class=\"mono\" style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9EA39B\">{{c.title}}</h3>\n<sc-for list=\"{{c.links}}\" as=\"l\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<a class=\"ulink\" href=\"{{l.href}}\" onClick=\"{{l.click}}\" style=\"align-self: flex-start; font-size: 15px; color: #DCDED8\">{{l.label}}</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"padding: 24px 0 32px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(242,240,234,0.1); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #9EA39B\" class=\"mono\">\n<span>© 2026 Public Pulse Agency. Dhaka, Bangladesh.</span>\n<span>BIN: 009043032-0102 · Trade License: TRAD/DNCC/037136/2025</span>\n<span style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap\"><a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://publicpulse.com.bd/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://publicpulse.com.bd/terms\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://publicpulse.com.bd/data-deletion\">Data Deletion</a></span>\n<span>Designed by <a class=\"ulink\" href=\"https://mahir.design\" style=\"color: #4BE38F\">mahir.design</a></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</template><template id=\"tpl-Insights\">\n<div class=\"pp\" style=\"padding-top: 76px\">\n<dc-import name=\"Nav\" active=\"insights\" hint-size=\"100%,76px\"></dc-import>\n\n<section style=\"position: relative; padding: 80px 0 60px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div class=\"gridbg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px\">\n<span class=\"mono fade-up\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9EA39B\"><a href=\"Main.dc.html\" class=\"ulink\">Home</a> / Insights</span>\n<span class=\"eyebrow fade-up\" style=\"color: #4BE38F\">Insights</span>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 40px\">\n<h1 class=\"h-xxl\"><span class=\"word\">Notes</span> <span class=\"word\" style=\"animation-delay: .08s\">from</span><br><span class=\"word\" style=\"animation-delay: .18s\">the</span> <span class=\"word\" style=\"animation-delay: .26s; color: #DE2A22; font-style: italic\">studio.</span></h1>\n<div class=\"fade-up\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 40px; animation-delay: .5s\">\n<div><span style=\"display: block; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 125%; font-size: 88px; line-height: .85; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: #4BE38F\">121</span><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #B9BDB6\">ARTICLES</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"display: block; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 125%; font-size: 88px; line-height: .85; letter-spacing: -0.05em\">10</span><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #B9BDB6\">CATEGORIES</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"padding: 20px 0 40px; position: stick